 :sourced-from "Corrected 2026-09-10. An earlier tick reported that korcham.net could not be navigated to a founding-history page and that a guessed history URL 404'd, and seeded the catalog from Wikipedia instead. The page does exist and is linked from korcham.net's own home page (:history-url); following the site's own links rather than guessing a path reaches KCCI's published chronology, which confirms the 1884 Hanseong Chamber of Commerce and dates the Chambers of Commerce and Industry Act to 1952-12-20. Note that BOTH cited hosts answer HTTP 200 for paths that do not exist (korcham.net returns a Korean not-found page, law.go.kr an error page), so a status probe cannot verify a citation on either host -- check for a marker in the body. The two statutes were cross-checked against law.go.kr's open API, which returned the same Act/Decree numbers and effective dates. Wikidata Q12592604's inception statement (1884) independently corroborates the founding year."}
